error[SC0104]: this `#ifdef` asks about a name the implementation may define
   ╭─[ an_ifdef_of_a_name_the_implementation_may_define_is_refused.c:6:1 ]
   │
 6 │ #ifdef __GNUC__
   │ ┬  
   │ ╰── directive begins here
───╯
  = note: `__GNUC__` is reserved for the implementation (C17 7.1.3), and whether it is defined depends on the compiler, so none of this conditional's groups is compiled
  = help: say whether the build defines it: `-D __GNUC__` if it does, `-U __GNUC__` if it does not
